Package: mdutils
Type: Package
Title: General-Purpose Data Utilities
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("mert6148", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Small, dependency-free helpers for cleaning and summarizing data
    frames. It provides tools to remove empty rows and columns, normalize
    column names, fill missing values, and calculate missing-value summaries.
